{"id":"4489a5a1ba1e9ec7","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-nrandom-cone-avoid.md","title":"n 随机点集中的非可计算上锥仍为零测集","display":"thm-nrandom-cone-avoid — n 随机点集中的非可计算上锥仍为零测集","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-nrandom-cone-avoid","aliases":["43-thm-nrandom-cone-avoid"],"display":"thm-nrandom-cone-avoid — n 随机点集中的非可计算上锥仍为零测集","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-nrandom]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-measure]]","[[43-thm-ml-cone]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-nrandom-cone-avoid"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-nrandom-cone-avoid</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nrandom-cone-avoid — n 随机点集中的非可计算上锥仍为零测集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8dd47210061e2447\" href=\"?note=8dd47210061e2447\" title=\"43-thm-ml-cone\">43-thm-ml-cone</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span> 为其特征函数；谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_n\\)</span> 是由正整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 索引的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上布尔谓词族，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\\)</span> 在本页只作用于特征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 上给出的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\">\\(\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{TotalComputable}(\\chi_A)\\Rightarrow\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\land A\\le_TX\\})=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{TotalComputable}(\\chi_A)\\Rightarrow\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\land A\\le_TX\\})=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由Sacks上锥零测度定理和集合包含推出。此结论是测度陈述，不能误读成“每个n随机点都避开任意非可计算上锥”。</p>\n<p>来源：本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-ml-cone","status":"resolved","id":"8dd47210061e2447","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-ml-cone]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\chi_A$ 为其特征函数；谓词见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\chi_A$ 为其特征函数；谓词见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\chi_A$ 为其特征函数；谓词见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Random}_n$ 是由正整数 $n$ 索引的 $2^\\omega$ 上布尔谓词族，见 [[43-df-nrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{TotalComputable}$ 在本页只作用于特征函数 $\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$，见 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Random}_n$ 是由正整数 $n$ 索引的 $2^\\omega$ 上布尔谓词族，见 [[43-df-nrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{TotalComputable}$ 在本页只作用于特征函数 $\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$，见 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu$ 是 [[43-df-cylinder]] 在 $\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 上给出的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度，满足 $\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{TotalComputable}(\\chi_A)\\Rightarrow\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\land A\\le_TX\\})=0.","display":true}],"bytes":1763,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-225","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-nrandom-cone-avoid]] — n 随机点集中的非可计算上锥仍为零测集"}],"outgoing":["ab1ef7b1cac112c1","86bdc33f83ee57a9","0784d1de3a88cd94","f357216a7edb035a","8e999d59227f4a28","8dd47210061e2447"]}